OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear skies at first, leading to a
OL,7,Fchilly night. Cloud tending to thicken
OL,8,Fthrough the evening, with a few
OL,9,Foutbreaks of rain possible towards
OL,10,Fdawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Fto start Monday. Rain becoming patchy
OL,14,Fand mainly confined to the Pennines
OL,15,Fduring the afternoon, with the best of
OL,16,Fany brightness developing in the
OL,17,Fsoutheast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
